5080 ' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- the game
5090 LABEL TITLE
5100 GOSUB CLEARALL
5110 GFX TEXT 200,20,"FRUIT",137,6,6
5120 GFX TEXT 160,100,"INVADERS",110,5,5
5130 SPRITE 0,ON:SPRITE 0,176,172,0
5140 SPRITE 1,ON:SPRITE 1,272,172,2
